 "Dispute Resolution Services | Adjudix Dispute Resolution Institute": "/dispute-resolution",
 "One institute, the full ADR spectrum": "/dispute-resolution",
 "From a facilitated conversation to a binding arbitral award, Adjudix administers every point on the alternative dispute resolution spectrum under the Adjudix Code of ADR Procedure, {0}.": "/dispute-resolution",
 "The spectrum, plainly explained": "/dispute-resolution",
 "Each mechanism trades off control and formality differently. Moving left to right, the parties give up more control over the outcome in exchange for a more decisive result.": "/dispute-resolution",
 "Negotiation": "/dispute-resolution",
 "The parties resolve the matter directly, with no third party involved.": "/dispute-resolution",
 "Conciliation": "/dispute-resolution",
 "A neutral conciliator actively proposes terms of settlement to both sides.": "/dispute-resolution",
 "Mediation": "/dispute-resolution",
 "A neutral mediator facilitates dialogue; the parties themselves reach the outcome.": "/dispute-resolution",
 "Lok Adalat": "/dispute-resolution",
 "A statutory forum for compromise settlement, with the force of a civil court decree.": "/dispute-resolution",
 "Arbitration": "/dispute-resolution",
 "A neutral arbitrator hears the case and issues a binding, enforceable award.": "/dispute-resolution",
 "Urgent interim relief from an emergency arbitrator, before a full tribunal is constituted.": "/dispute-resolution",
 "Corporate ADR": "/dispute-resolution",
 "Standing dispute resolution for businesses, preserving the commercial relationship.": "/dispute-resolution",
 "Hybrid process of Med-Arb": "/dispute-resolution",
